Wm2: is rt_w2 & RSsrc ; wm_dir=1 & wm_count=0 & S9 { *:4 (RSsrc + S9 + 8) = rt_w2; }
Wm2: is rt_w2 & RSsrc ; wm_dir=1 & wm_count>2 & S9 { *:4 (RSsrc + S9 + 8) = rt_w2; }
Wm2: is rt=0 & RSsrc ; wm_dir=1 & wm_count=0 & S9 { *:4 (RSsrc + S9 + 8) = 0:4; }
Wm2: is rt=0 & RSsrc ; wm_dir=1 & wm_count>2 & S9 { *:4 (RSsrc + S9 + 8) = 0:4; }
Wm3: is rt ; wm_count>0 & wm_count<4 { }
